{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26656","headline":"寄杨工部闻毘陵舍弟自罨溪入茶山 · 姚合","name":"寄杨工部闻毘陵舍弟自罨溪入茶山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采茶溪路好，花影半浮沈。\n画舸僧同上，春山客共寻。\n芳新生石际，幽嫩在山阴。\n色是春光染，香惊日气侵。\n试尝应酒醒，封进定恩深。\n芳贻千里外，怡怡太府吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}